            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana wamumbanda wanyikanka, dipompeshi nyikanka nyikanka. Yena natukuchiki dehi. Mukwakusompesha Isarela akamweta mutondu kwikidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi Betelemi Efwarata, eyi wasweja kukehela mukachi kamakombakaji awaYuda, mudeyi mwakafuma wumu wakenza kudami, diyi wakekala mukwakuyula muIsarela; kwidejeka kwindi kwakufumisha kushankulu, kunyaka yahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wakayileka tuhu kwindi, kushika nikumwaka wakela owu wudi nakufunyisha navwali dehi. Henohu ana kwindi anashali akafunta kudi anyana kaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakemana naku diisha mukanka windi wanyikoku naŋovu yaYehova, nawukeleŋi wejina daYehova Nzambi yindŋ niwena akashakama chachiwahi; muloŋa henohu nekali dehi muneni kushika nikunsa jeseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeniwu diyi wakekala kuwunda kwetu, hakenzawu aAshuri mwituŋa detu, hakadatawu mumataletu awanta, twakayinyamwina atubiŋa atanu nayedi, niatulamba atanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena akakisaŋana ituŋa dawaAshuri nampoku yakabali, akakisaŋana niituŋa daNimirodi kumawiŋililu adu. Wakatupulwisha kudi aAshuri hakeŋilawu mwituŋa detu, hakadatawu muŋinza yetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AkwaYakoba akashala akekala mukachi kanyuza yayivulu neyi wuumi wakudi Yehova, neyi nvula jawo-wo-wo jikunoka hamatahu, jikubula kulabila antu, jikubula kuchiŋilila anyana kawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AkwaYakoba akashala akekala mukachi kawajentili, mukachi kanyuza yawantu yayivulu, neyi mutupa wudi mukachi kawanyama amwisaŋa, neyi mwenzi wamutupa wudi mukachi kanyikanka yanyikoku; yena neyi ahitamu wukudatola, wukutabola chakadi niniwu wukupulwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikasa cheyi chiyinyamukili akwankunyi neyi, ayilumbu jeyi ejima ayifumishuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hefuku odu nakafumisha tuwalu twenu mukachi kenu, nakakisaŋana makálu enu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakafumisha nyikala yamwituŋa denu, nakasandola yipaka yenu yimwadikaŋila yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakafumisha yakupandapanda mumakasenu; himwakekala nawa cheŋi nawakwakuhoŋa natutumbwaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakafumisha akishi enu akusoŋa, nituposhi twenu twakupeshela twekala mukachi kenu; himwakadifukula nawa cheŋi kunyidimu yamakasenuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabwita nyiyombu yenu yidi mukachi kenu. Nakajilumuna nyikala yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuza yabulili kutiyilila nakakoŋahu yakutenda chakuzuwa nakulendumuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
